  7845                                  ; ============================================================
  7846                                  ;  Aliases ("ali <name> <commands>")
  7847                                  ;
  7848                                  ;  An alias binds a name to an arbitrary command string (which may
  7849                                  ;  itself contain ; chains and a ~ pipe). Defining one is intercepted
  7850                                  ;  as raw text before ; splitting ever sees it (try_handle_ali_line,
