  7858                                  ; at least one command, stores the alias and returns al=1 (caller
  7859                                  ; should treat the line as fully handled and not process it further).
  7860                                  ; Otherwise returns al=0 and leaves line_buf untouched, so the caller
  7861                                  ; processes the line normally.
