 10255                                  ; ------------------------------------------------------------------
 10256                                  ;  AHCI (SATA) driver. Talks to the HBA over MMIO (its ABAR, found via
 10257                                  ;  PCI BAR5) instead of legacy IDE ports - a different I/O model from the
 10258                                  ;  ata_* driver above, but the disk is identity-mapped memory either way
 10259                                  ;  once ahci_mark_uncached has run, so it's read/written with plain
 10260                                  ;  mov/or/and just like any other buffer in this file. No interrupts are
 10261                                  ;  used here either, matching the polled style of the rest of the OS:
 10262                                  ;  commands are issued and then polled for completion on PxCI.
 10263                                  ; ------------------------------------------------------------------
 10264                                  PCI_CMD_OFFSET  equ 0x04
 10265                                  PCI_BAR5_OFFSET equ 0x24
 10266                                  AHCI_TIMEOUT    equ 0x400000
 10267                                  
 10268                                  ; ahci_mark_uncached: edi = a physical address inside the 2MB page to mark
 10269                                  ; uncached (sets PCD, bit4) in the identity-map PDs built by
 10270                                  ; expand_identity_map (4 contiguous page directories at 0x3000..0x6FFF,
 10271                                  ; 512 entries each, 2MB pages). Without this, polling an HBA register
 10272                                  ; through a cacheable mapping could read back a stale value instead of
 10273                                  ; what the device just wrote - the ABAR sits in a dedicated MMIO range
 10274                                  ; that nothing else in this kernel uses, so marking its whole 2MB page
 10275                                  ; uncached doesn't affect anything else.
 10276                                  ahci_mark_uncached:
