 10606                                  ; vol_read: al = device id (0..3), rdi = base node index.
 10607                                  ; Loads an SFFS v5 volume from that device into the node table at
 10608                                  ; [base .. base+VOL_NODES) plus that volume's cached free-block bitmap.
 10609                                  ; For the OS volume (base 0) parents are copied verbatim; for mounted
 10610                                  ; volumes, on-disk relative parent indices are remapped to the mount's
 10611                                  ; global slice and the volume root becomes a child of the OS root (parent 0).
 10612                                  ; returns rax = 0 on success, -1 on failure (absent device, bad magic,
 10613                                  ; or an I/O error). Sets fs_disk_available=0 when the device never
