 11580                                  ; descriptor gets handed to it (OWN set) but the engine never actually
 11581                                  ; drains it, even though the copper PHY link itself is up (PHY link state
 11582                                  ; and PCIe link power state are independent). QEMU's virtual PCIe root port
 11583                                  ; doesn't implement ASPM at all, which is why this is invisible there. Walks
 11584                                  ; the same capabilities list pci_pm_wake does, looking for PCI_CAP_ID_EXP
