 12699                                      ; this loop is plain-RAM-polling. PCI/PCIe ordering only guarantees a
 12700                                      ; posted write has landed once a read that traverses the same path
 12701                                      ; completes ("reads push writes") - a legacy CF8/CFC config cycle is a
 12702                                      ; much stronger/slower completion barrier on real chipsets than an I/O
