 14632                                  ; capture tool available. rsi = frame ptr, rcx = frame length in bytes.
 14633                                  ; Only called when nic_diag_verbose is set (during the dhcp wait), so
 14634                                  ; normal shell use isn't spammed by a dump on every packet sent.
