 15131                                  ; ============================================================
 15132                                  ;  CALC EXPRESSION EVALUATOR
 15133                                  ;  Supports +, -, *, / with standard precedence (* / before + -),
 15134                                  ;  unary minus, decimal literals, and variable names as operands.
 15135                                  ;  eval_expr: rsi = expression text (null-terminated) -> rax=result,
