  1876                              <1>     ; to the scheduler once party_bg_quantum is exhausted. party_bg_active
  1877                              <1>     ; is 1 only while bg_step_proc is driving us - a foreground party/run
  1878                              <1>     ; never yields here. On resume the scheduler has reset party_bg_quantum
  1879                              <1>     ; and party_bg_suspend drops us back at this exact statement boundary.
