  1969                              <1> ; ---- rush <expr> ----
  1970                              <1> ; Evaluates <expr> (must be a string) and feeds it to the Rush/
  1971                              <1> ; ShellyForever shell exactly the way a typed prompt line would be:
  1972                              <1> ; through process_chain, so ';' chaining, quoted args, aliases and
