  1974                              <1> ; the party compiler itself via "party compile x.pa", etc.) all just
  1975                              <1> ; work with no separate reimplementation here. Party scripts still
  1976                              <1> ; can't reach the shell any other way - this is the one deliberate
  1977                              <1> ; door, and it only opens for a string the script itself built.
