  2644                              <1> ; ------------------------------------------------------------
  2645                              <1> ; party_reset_runtime: resets the shared global interpreter state
  2646                              <1> ; (value stack, variable/locals/frame tables, flags, x87 FPU) to a
  2647                              <1> ; fresh pre-run condition, exactly like party_exec initializes on
  2648                              <1> ; entry. Used before lexing+collecting a compiled .run program so a
  2649                              <1> ; previous party/run leaves no stale state behind. Clobbers rdi, rsi,
  2650                              <1> ; rcx, rax and the FPU.
  2651                              <1> ; ------------------------------------------------------------
  2652                              <1> party_reset_runtime:
