  3062                              <1> ; ============================================================
  3063                              <1> ; Each party_parse_* evaluates its production and leaves exactly one
  3064                              <1> ; value on the value stack, advancing r13 past everything it
  3065                              <1> ; consumed. Every level is a no-op once party_exec_ok==0, so errors
  3066                              <1> ; unwind naturally. The value stack is left balanced on success
