  3411                              <1> ; rcx = length. Expands {identifier} substitutions and {{ / }}
  3412                              <1> ; brace escapes into party_interp_buf.
  3413                              <1> ; Out: on success, party_exec_ok stays 1, rdi = party_interp_buf,
  3414                              <1> ; rcx = result length. On error, sets party_exec_ok = 0 via
  3415                              <1> ; party_set_err (caller's r13 must still point at the TOK_STR token
  3416                              <1> ; so the reported line number is right) and rdi/rcx are undefined -
  3417                              <1> ; caller must check party_exec_ok before using them.
