  3419                              <1> ; aliasing caveat PARTY_SPEC.md already documents for `read` and for
  3420                              <1> ; string literals sharing the source buffer - a later interpolated
  3421                              <1> ; literal overwrites an earlier one's text, so a var holding an
  3422                              <1> ; interpolated string needs to be consumed (displayed, rushed,
  3423                              <1> ; compared, etc.) before the next interpolated literal is evaluated
  3424                              <1> ; if the old text must still be around.
