   684                              <1> ; http_status_code: rsi = raw HTTP response buffer, ecx = its length.
   685                              <1> ; Both "HTTP/1.1" and "HTTP/1.0" are 8 bytes, so the status line's
   686                              <1> ; 3-digit code always starts at offset 9 regardless of minor version
