    20                              <1> ;    - HKDF-Expand-Label (RFC 8446 7.1) against a hand-verified
    21                              <1> ;      Python reference, with and without a context field
    22                              <1> ;
    23                              <1> ;  Temporary command: this file adds "cryptotest" to the shell so
    24                              <1> ;  the self-test can be run on real hardware/QEMU, not just under
    25                              <1> ;  the Linux harness used during development. Per phases.txt, this
    26                              <1> ;  command's slot gets reclaimed once Phase 2 or Phase 5 need it --
