   526                              <1>     ; TLS connection; going without it is an unusual fingerprint some
   527                              <1>     ; edges use to silently drop scripted-looking clients rather than
   528                              <1>     ; sending back an alert. We only ever speak HTTP/1.1, so offer just
   529                              <1>     ; that one protocol.
