   601                              <1> ;  tls_parse_server_hello -- rsi = SH handshake body ptr
   602                              <1> ;  (points at legacy_version, i.e. after the 4-byte handshake
   603                              <1> ;  header). Extracts server pubkey into tls_server_pub, checks the
   604                              <1> ;  suite. CF=1 on error.
