    53 0005B831 C3                  <1>     ret
    54                              <1> 
    55                              <1> ; browse_cp_str_max: rsi = src, rdi = dst, rcx = max bytes (incl NUL).
    56                              <1> ; Copies at most rcx-1 chars plus a NUL. rdi advances.
    57                              <1> browse_cp_str_max:
