 16253                                  ; putchar: al = char to print, uses attribute in bl if caller set it via
 16254                                  ; print_string_attr; falls back to ATTR_NORMAL when called directly.
 16255                                  ; When pipe_capture_on is set (a "~" pipe is capturing a command's
 16256                                  ; output - see process_segment), characters are appended to
 16257                                  ; pipe_capture_buf instead of touching the screen/cursor at all.
 16258                                  serial_init:
