 16719                                  ; ============================================================
 16720                                  ;  SCROLLBACK VIEW (Ctrl+Up / Ctrl+Down)
 16721                                  ; ============================================================
 16722                                  ; All of these routines save/restore every register they use, so they are
 16723                                  ; safe to call from anywhere inside get_char without disturbing a caller
 16724                                  ; like read_line that keeps its own state (buffer ptr/length/max) in
 16725                                  ; r8/r9/r10 across get_char calls.
 16726                                  
 16727                                  ; scrollback_capture_row: archives the current row 0 (about to be shifted
