 17039                                  ; .remove_at_cursor: deletes the buffer byte at index r11, shifting
 17040                                  ; everything after it left by one, and decrements r8. Does not touch the
 17041                                  ; screen or r11 itself - callers handle cursor movement/redraw. Clobbers
 17042                                  ; rax/rdx.
 17043                                  .remove_at_cursor:
